msgid "Hides films that are only in cinemas. You only see what you can watch already."
msgstr "Verbergt films die nog alleen in de bioscoop draaien. Je ziet alleen wat al te kijken is."

msgctxt "#32315"
msgid "Choose languages you do not want to see films or series in."
msgstr "Kies talen waarvan je geen films of series wilt zien."

msgctxt "#32316"
